*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.spec.ts
*.spec.tsx
test/
tests/
playwright/
.playwright/
playwright-report/
test-results/
e2e/
cypress/

# Documentation (not needed in runtime)
*.md
docs/
documentation/
PRODUCTION_READINESS.md
audit-report.md
CHANGELOG*
LICENSE*
✅_*.md
STRIPE_SECURITY.md

